### 1.2 GitHub Actions Workflows

Automated workflows handle continuous integration, code formatting, reviewer assignment, and deployment[cite: 6]:

| Workflow | Trigger | Execution Steps |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **CI** | PR or push targeting `feature/staging-part-2`[cite: 6] | Runs `black`, `isort`, `flake8`, `sqlfluff`, `pytest`, and `databricks bundle validate`[cite: 6]. |
| **Deploy Databricks Bundle** | Push targeting `feature/staging-part-2`[cite: 6] | Validates $\rightarrow$ deploys $\rightarrow$ runs `NYC_Mobility` (uses `DATABRICKS_HOST` and `DATABRICKS_TOKEN` secrets)[cite: 6]. |
| **PR Checks** | PR targeting `main` or `staging`[cite: 6] | Project structure validation + `pytest` suite execution[cite: 6]. |
| **Auto Format & Commit** | PR opened or updated[cite: 6] | Applies `sqlfluff fix`, `black`, `isort`, `nbstripout`, and commits changes directly back to the PR branch[cite: 6]. |
| **Auto Assign Reviewer** | PR opened[cite: 6] | Rotates reviewers: `jess-christine` $\rightarrow$ `catweyine` $\rightarrow$ `jg0901` $\rightarrow$ `go-viaaa` $\rightarrow$ `JoanMaquinano` $\rightarrow$ `jess-christine`[cite: 6]. |

> ⚠️ **Deployment Status & Known Blockers (As of 2026-09-25):**[cite: 6]
> * ✅ **PR Checks** & **Auto Assign Reviewer** workflows pass successfully[cite: 6].
> * ❌ **CI Workflow Failure**: Fails at the `sqlfluff` step due to missing `param_style` in the placeholder templater config (blocking downstream `pytest` and bundle validation)[cite: 6].
> * ❌ **Deploy Run #1 Failure**: Failed with `401 Unauthorized`—requires the `DATABRICKS_TOKEN` secret to be configured in the GitHub `staging` environment[cite: 6].
