### 1.3 Databricks Asset Bundle Targets (`databricks.yml`)

The repository supports distinct execution environments via Databricks Asset Bundles[cite: 6]:

| Target | Mode | Operational Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `dev` *(Default)* | Development mode (resources prefixed per user)[cite: 6] | Staging integration runs triggered from CI workflows[cite: 6]. |
| `prod` | Production mode (root path: `~/.bundle/nyc_mobility/prod`)[cite: 6] | Production pipeline deployment and schedule execution[cite: 6]. |

